; A total cost {{USD}} completes its total; the per-unit cost divides it at
; 28 digits, so the transaction misses by 1e-26, and a short sale's total
; keeps its sign.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Stock
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2020-02-01 * "buy"
  Assets:Stock   3 HOOL {{USD}}
  Assets:Cash   -100 USD
2020-02-02 * "short"
  Assets:Stock   -2 HOOL {{USD}}
  Assets:Cash   100 USD
